<p style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 16px;color:#ffffff;">Confirm your email</p>
<p>Hi{{#if firstName}} {{firstName}}{{/if}}, confirm this address so we can protect your AUTHENTIC account.</p>
<p style="margin:28px 0;">
  <a href="{{{verifyUrl}}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#14b8a6;color:#06201c;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:999px;">Verify email</a>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#8ea0bb;">This link expires in 24 hours. If you did not create an account, ignore this email.</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#8ea0bb;">API clients can POST the token to <code>/api/v1/auth/verify-email</code>:<br />{{token}}</p>
